Package: seine
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         ansible,
         crun,
         passt,
         podman,
         python3-boto3,
         python3-cryptography,
         python3-guestfs,
         qemu-kvm,
         qemu-utils,
         seine-vault-image
Recommends: gnupg,
            python3-pydantic,
            python3-websockets,
            skopeo,
            syft
Suggests: qemu-user-static
Description: slim embedded images, now easy
 seine builds bootable images (disk images, rootfs tarballs, containers)
 from a YAML specification, using podman to run each build step in a
 throwaway container and libguestfs to write the result to its final
 image format.
 .
 This package provides the seine command line tool.

Package: seine-oci-bookworm
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: seine (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: prebuilt debian:bookworm base image
 The 'debian:bookworm' image for this package's own architecture,
 imported into podman on first use instead of pulled from a registry --
 the only image any of seine's own container builds ever pull rather
 than build locally.
 Install alongside seine-oci-trixie for both releases.

Package: seine-oci-trixie
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: seine (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: prebuilt debian:trixie base image
 The 'debian:trixie' image for this package's own architecture,
 imported into podman on first use instead of pulled from a registry --
 the only image any of seine's own container builds ever pull rather
 than build locally.
 Install alongside seine-oci-bookworm for both releases.

Package: seine-vault-openbao
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: seine (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Provides: seine-vault-image
Description: prebuilt vault image (openbao plus seine's signing plugins)
 The custom OpenBao image (upstream plus seine's seine-pgp,
 seine-sbsign and seine-kmod signing plugins) for this package's own
 architecture, imported into podman on first use instead of building
 the plugins from source.
 .
 Provides the seine-vault-image virtual package that seine depends on.

Package: seine-server
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         python3-boto3,
         python3-cryptography,
         python3-fastapi,
         python3-pydantic,
         python3-requests,
         python3-uvicorn,
         python3-websockets,
         python3-yaml
Description: build scheduler and REST API server for seine
 seine-server is the central API and scheduling daemon for distributed
 seine builds. It manages projects, role-based access control (RBAC),
 worker registration, and job queues.
 .
 This package provides the seine-server command and systemd service.

Package: seine-agent
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: seine (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         python3-boto3,
         python3-pydantic,
         python3-requests,
         python3-websockets,
         uidmap
Description: distributed worker agent daemon for seine
 seine-agent runs on build hosts to auto-detect hardware capabilities
 (native architecture, binfmt_misc emulation, cross-compilers, Podman, KVM),
 enroll with a seine-server, claim queued builds, and stream execution
 logs in real time over WebSocket.
 .
 This package provides the seine-agent command and systemd service.
